  "content": "Fly a low-poly biplane around a tiny planet you can circle in about a minute. Weave through rock arches, needle spires, floating islands and the Great Rift canyon with momentum-based flight: keep your speed up or the wings stall. Up to four pilots share the screen with game controllers for split-screen dogfights: fixed guns with light aim assist, per-part battle damage, and two heat-seeking rockets on the wings that reload over time. Rockets turn slower than you do, so a hard bank can shake one, and a missed rocket coasts round the planet and may come back for its own pilot. Beginner steering banks and pulls for you; normal mode gives full manual control. Plays with keyboard, gamepad or touch, in any frame from a small widget to full screen.",
